# Production build settings. No secrets here.
#
# Empty on purpose: a deployed site answers its own calls from a store in the
# visitor's browser. Nothing leaves the tab, which is exactly what a demo of the
# submission journey wants — no dashboard has to be awake, no serverless
# instance can go cold and lose a film halfway through, and what was sent is
# still there tomorrow.
#
# To send submissions to the dashboard instead, put its API back here:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://weshort-admin.vercel.app/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
